			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Kouzen"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120230201,
					"content": "Whew... this guy smells of booze...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230202,
					"content": "Mm? Wait, wait, don't tell me... Captain of Swordfish II! Right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230203,
					"content": "You actually came back. I thought you'd abandoned the platoon and made a run for it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230204,
					"content": "Nuh-uh! We would never run from a fight!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230205,
					"content": "Hmph, is that so. All anyone talks about these days is peace and stability.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230206,
					"content": "Do you remember what the most important thing is to the resistance?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230207,
					"content": "A warrior's will.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120230208,
					"content": "You got that right. So I'm gonna put you to the test. Time to see if you truly are a bona fide resistance warrior.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230209,
					"content": "I'll answer your questions — but only if you can beat me in a duel.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230210,
					"content": "Ugh, this guy... Would it kill him to just have a normal conversation...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230211,
					"content": "#What do you think, are we gonna do this, {NICKNAME}?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230212,
						120230213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230212,
					"content": "Sure. We're hardly going to lose.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230214
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120230214,
					"content": "Hmph... We'll see about that!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230213,
					"content": "In a few seconds you'll be begging to talk!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230214
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1202303,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1202305,
				1202312
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1202305",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1202305,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Kouzen"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120230301,
					"content": "You're a strong fighter... No wonder Her Excellency chose you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230302,
					"content": "You really do have a warrior's will... Then, maybe you can understand us.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230303,
					"content": "Captain, comrade... will you join us?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230304,
					"content": "First you need to tell me what's going on.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120230305,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230306,
					"content": "We made it up. The story about the Tenryou Commission colluding with the Fatui... It didn't happen.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230307,
					"content": "WHAT!? Poor Kokomi's been worried sick! You're telling us you made the whole thing up?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230308,
					"content": "What the heck were you thinking? This could send you right back into war with the Tenryou Commission!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230309,
					"content": "Yes. That's exactly what we're hoping to achieve.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230310,
					"content": "Peace talks? Pfft... Everyone's been drawn in by the idea. That's why the future of Watatsumi Island is at stake.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230311,
					"content": "What's to stop the Tenryou Commission from stabbing us in the back? And what's to stop the Raiden Shogun from issuing another Vision Hunt Decree?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230312,
					"content": "We are the resistance! Everything hinges on our warrior's will!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230313,
					"content": "We can't trust the Tenryou Commission or the Raiden Shogun. But we can put faith in ourselves!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230314,
					"content": "Surely you agree with that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230315,
					"content": "His point does kinda make sense, but something about it doesn't feel right to Paimon...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230316,
					"content": "What it boils down to is... you just want to fight.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230317
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120230317,
					"content": "Yeah! Everything you said just now was pure speculation, wasn't it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230318,
					"content": "Are you seriously willing to make up a wild rumor and ruin the peace everyone's worked so hard for, all because of some imaginary situation that may not even happen?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230319,
					"content": "Don't take that tone with me, acting like you're above all of this! What would you understand?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230320,
					"content": "For the sake of victory, we embodied the warrior's will to the fullest. You understand? We were all in. Now they're suddenly trying to tell us that none of it matters anymore...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230321,
					"content": "You'd have me just put down my weapon and start living like an ordinary person, but how can I? How can I, when... when every time I close my eyes, I see the faces of the friends we lost in battle.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230322,
					"content": "Every time I see them there, in my mind's eye, it reminds me that I can never forgive the Tenryou Commission, and never forgive the Vision Hunt Decree!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230323,
					"content": "I guess you're not one of us... Well, whatever. Go ahead and tell Sangonomiya if you want. But you're too late to stop us now...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230324,
					"content": "Too late? What do you mean?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230325,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kouzen"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230326,
					"content": "Darn, doesn't seem like he's gonna answer that one.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230327,
					"content": "#What are we gonna do, {NICKNAME}? This is really serious! We need to give Kokomi the full story right away!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1202304,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1202306,
				1202307
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1202306",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1202306,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Sangonomiya Kokomi"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120230401,
					"content": "...So we found out a few things.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230402,
					"content": "The whole thing about the Tenryou Commission colluding with the Fatui is baloney! They made it all up.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230403,
					"content": "They wanted the peace talks to break down so that they could carry on fighting the war. And they said that it's too late to try and stop them, no matter what we do.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230404,
					"content": "Mm. I see.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230405,
						120230406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sangonomiya Kokomi"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230405,
					"content": "What's the matter, Kokomi?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230407
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120230407,
					"content": "I'm fine, don't worry.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sangonomiya Kokomi"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230408,
					"content": "This is my fault. If only I'd perceived what they were feeling earlier, it never would have come to this.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sangonomiya Kokomi"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230409,
					"content": "I think I understand what Kouzen means when he says it's too late.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sangonomiya Kokomi"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230410,
					"content": "The talks don't begin until tomorrow, but both sides have already sent their guards to the location. They are responsible for making sure the area is safe and secure.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sangonomiya Kokomi"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230411,
					"content": "I highly suspect that one of Kouzen's pro-war co-conspirators will have infiltrated the guards with an intent to reignite hostilities tomorrow during the negotiations.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sangonomiya Kokomi"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230412,
					"content": "Well that's no good. Do you want us to head over there now and switch out the guards?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230413,
					"content": "That won't work. Firstly, the act of bringing a new team of guards to a neutral negotiation site will put both sides on high alert.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sangonomiya Kokomi"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230414,
					"content": "It would almost certainly push the pro-war faction into taking action. They would attack the Tenryou Commission's guards, and we'd be in danger of war breaking out once again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sangonomiya Kokomi"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230415,
					"content": "Not to mention that we have no idea how many of Watatsumi Island's soldiers are involved in this plot. If we change the guard in haste, we face the issue of not knowing who to trust.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sangonomiya Kokomi"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230416,
					"content": "Sounds like a really tricky situation... so, is there really nothing we can do about it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230417,
					"content": "Don't let it worry you, what's done is done. Mm... Now it falls to me to devise a counter plan.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sangonomiya Kokomi"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230418,
					"content": "These soldiers crossed a line, but the blame is not theirs alone. Whatever happens, I will find a way to ensure they do not come to harm...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sangonomiya Kokomi"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230419,
					"content": "Let's meet here again tomorrow.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Sangonomiya Kokomi"
				},
				{
					"id": 120230406,
					"content": "Are you feeling alright?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120230407
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1202305,
